				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				152,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Sky): Add WebviewHost shell page for extension webview windows\n\nCreate WebviewHost.astro as a lightweight HTML shell served at /Mountain/WebviewHost.html via the localhost plugin. WebviewProvider/Lifecycle.rs now creates each extension panel as a Tauri WebviewWindow targeting this URL instead of WebviewUrl::App(\"WebviewHost.html\"), which fails when frontendDist is null.\n\nThe page establishes a Tauri IPC bridge for secondary extension panel windows by forwarding __WEBVIEW_INITIAL_STATE__ to the main window via window.opener.postMessage with a \"webview-host-ready\" event. This allows Sky's bridge layer to resolve pending webview handles without relying on the primary window's frontendDist.\n\nExtension panels now render correctly in their own Tauri WebviewWindow while maintaining IPC communication with the main editor window.",
			"SHA": "15bf6df6ed627faccbdd71aa31ca1c978e425c8f"
		}
	],
